<title>THAILAND: Thai M-2 money supply up 11.3 pct yr/yr in April.</title>
<headline>Thai M-2 money supply up 11.3 pct yr/yr in April.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's M-2 money supply rose 11.3 percent year on year in April against revised 10.8 percent growth in March, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the M-2 supply figure rose to an estimated 3.87 trillion baht in April from 3.85 trillion in March.</p>
<p>    M-2			 April 97   March 97     April 96</p>
<p>    Money supply		3.87	3.85	    3.48</p>
<p>    Percentage change	11.3	10.8	    21.3</p>
<p>Note - Money supply figures are in trillions of baht. The Bank of Thailand said April figure was an estimate.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-6520642</p>
</text>
